# Public (non-secret) defaults for production builds of the demo deployment.
# These values are baked into every client bundle by design — the publishable
# key grants only what anonymous browser traffic already has (RLS applies).
# Real environment variables (Vercel dashboard / your own host) override them;
# self-hosters MUST set their own project values (docs/self-hosting.md).
#
# Secrets (SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, BYOK_ENCRYPTION_KEY, JOBS_SECRET,
# RESEND_API_KEY, ...) are NEVER committed — see docs/deployment.md.
